Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:43.23,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Every ten seconds, she gets all giggly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:46.49,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Probably doesn't realize she's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.49,0:01:47.50,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Leave her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:49.87,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:53.09,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm not concentrating at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.43,0:01:55.38,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I keep spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:58.55,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}We got back from camping yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:01.36,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}and it's finally sinking in...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.12,0:02:05.69,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}That Akira-san and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.03,0:02:07.29,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}kissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:14.31,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}That was my... first kiss, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:17.48,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, she's giggling again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:20.94,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I mean, I've never had \Nany romantic experiences!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:23.20,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Has she been like this all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:25.61,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Yeah. Broken record since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:33.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. I'm sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:33.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:36.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shall we head home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:37.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:39.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:42.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What would you think of \Nstopping by a bar after dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.55,0:02:52.07,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I... I was just thinking... it's nice \Nthat you're so unaffected by it all...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.63,0:02:56.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I mean, the fact you're \Nso calm and collected!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:03:00.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I almost feel like \NI should take offense at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:02.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:06.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. Your hand, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:10.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you at the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:15.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't want you thinking you're \Nthe only one who's nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.69,0:03:18.53,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:22.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was completely beside myself \Non the bench that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sure you realized that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:31.79,Flashback - Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,He's pressed against \Nmy back... He's so warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:38.13,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Or do you dislike men \Nwho aren't always the picture of dignity?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:40.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Actually, I lo—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:43.63,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I prefer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:45.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Did you just change your wording?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:52.58,Main,Staff,0,0,0,,One Scarlett O'Hara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:54.82,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:56.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:03:59.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The glass seems very small.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:01.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's a cocktail glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:03.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Do you go to bars?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:09.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's pretty rare for me \Nto drink outside my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:14.07,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Do most people come to bars to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:17.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, they're a place you go to enjoy \Nthe pure pleasure of drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.33,0:04:22.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Or when you want to spend \Nmore time with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:27.55,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Everything he says makes \Nmy heart skip a beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:29.86,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I need to toughen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:32.78,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I recommend the fruity cocktails here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:36.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is it okay for you to drink so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:39.81,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:42.94,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're over here, right, Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:44.38,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:48.14,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sit by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:51.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:54.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I need to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:58.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I have no romantic experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:02.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're disgusted \Nby my unrelenting childishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:04.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:07.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm older, anyway, so don't—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:09.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Do not interrupt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:14.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That kiss, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:18.34,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-It was my first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:21.63,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Forgive me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.79,0:05:25.98,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Did I sound like a child there too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:27.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:30.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to make you uncomfortable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:32.27,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:36.96,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Why does she always want \Nforgiveness for things?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:41.28,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Though, I've seen hints \Nof that since our first date...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:44.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let's just have some water for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Water, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:47.25,Main,Bartender,0,0,0,,Coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:54.78,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Akira-san's so quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.95,0:05:59.01,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Why did I say all that nonsense?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.95,0:06:03.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:04.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.23,0:06:10.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Driver, could you wait here for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.61,0:06:15.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um... Would you like to come in for tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Not today, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:24.77,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}He's disgusted with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:32.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well... Thank you \Nfor getting me home safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:37.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:46.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can tell you have complicated feelings \Nabout what we talked about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:48.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But please...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:52.06,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,give me permission to treasure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.49,0:06:54.01,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:58.33,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I feel more than \Nadequately treasured by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:07:00.86,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You even gave me that raise earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:04.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:06.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can go home with a light heart, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:12.01,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san! Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:33.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's raining so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.56,0:07:36.14,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Sh-Shizuka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:37.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Akira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.05,0:07:41.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's raining so hard out there. \NI'm just miserable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.58,0:07:43.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Even my handkerchief is soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:45.98,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Th-That sounds awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:50.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I put a heater on the table by the sofa,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.69,0:07:51.87,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:53.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here's a towel for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:56.45,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:59.38,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You seem very well prepared...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Did you get rained on, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine. Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.62,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.19,0:08:11.09,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Even my undershirt is soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:14.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I-I'll find you a blanket!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.85,0:08:16.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I really appreciate that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:22.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It took some time to find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:23.90,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.37,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank yo—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:30.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Your hands are wet. And they're cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:35.91,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Your clothing's soaked, too! \NYou're not fine at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:39.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You took advantage \Nof my blindness, darn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:40.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:45.71,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's still raining, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:46.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:50.72,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The heater's nice and warm, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:53.87,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:56.44,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}We're pressed together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.44,0:08:58.87,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}And he's calm and I'm a mess! \NI'm so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.68,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}That's Akira-san's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:06.69,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I should return the gesture somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:09.03,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.15,0:09:12.72,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Getting to do this with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:16.94,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It makes me... very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:20.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:25.44,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Is he going to... kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:32.09,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,It's pouring buckets out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.32,0:09:35.02,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Did you guys get rained on as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:37.09,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, we did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:39.82,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let me adjust the temperature here...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:47.60,Italics,Yukari,0,0,0,,It sounds like your boyfriend \Nis trying to be considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:51.85,Italics,Yukari,0,0,0,,Remember how awkward \Nour first meeting was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.85,0:09:57.39,Italics,Yukari,0,0,0,,It's best for us to meet up properly \Nand get a fresh start!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:00.24,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}And that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:03.28,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Hello! I'm Shizuka's mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:04.87,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.03,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.03,0:10:08.83,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for barging in on you that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:11.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, the fault is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:13.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:17.16,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Manju? How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.31,0:10:21.27,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}What should I even talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.74,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Is this gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:28.28,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}one of those "are you thinking \Nabout marriage" conversations?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:35.44,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}It's way too early for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:35.25,Main - Top,Yukari,0,0,0,,Really? You do that too?{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:36.77,Main - Top,Yukari,0,0,0,,That's so impressive!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:41.80,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I wonder if Akira-san is thinking \Nabout what happened before...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.77,0:10:37.94,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:40.03,Main - Top,Yukari,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll hire you sometime!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.03,0:10:41.80,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,Come by anytime!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.32,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Oh, that's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:45.83,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tonome-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:47.61,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank him for what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:49.92,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,What, weren't you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:52.60,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,He's giving me a 30% \N"girlfriend's mother"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.60,0:10:55.19,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,discount on any future investigations!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:57.38,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,GIRLFRIEND'S MOTHER
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:57.02,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is that what this is about, Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.49,0:11:00.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And don't you encourage her, Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:01.90,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,My mother is very incorrigible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:04.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You seem to be good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:07.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What do you want to hire him for, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:10.08,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Check your father for infidelity, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:11.50,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.63,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That's not funny in the slightest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry my mother is so brazen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:20.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:23.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was nervous about meeting \Nher for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:25.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but she really kept things flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,She's a good mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:29.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm glad you feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We also discussed something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:34.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Something important?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:38.40,Flashback,Yukari,0,0,0,,How is Shizuka doing at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:41.07,Flashback,Yukari,0,0,0,,Is she getting along with her coworkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:41.92,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:44.09,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,She's extremely capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.36,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,We're all reliant on her, \Nmyself included.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:49.54,Flashback,Yukari,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:53.30,Flashback,Yukari,0,0,0,,She's really out there in the world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.03,Flashback,Yukari,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:59.43,Flashback,Yukari,0,0,0,,Tonome-san. Please look \Nafter my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.13,0:12:02.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:05.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Ah. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:12.71,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,SEASONAL ROSE GARDEN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:12.70,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.87,0:12:15.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Where are we going today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let me give you a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.63,0:12:21.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It smells like a flower...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:24.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A rose, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.63,0:12:26.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:28.77,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:31.07,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.39,0:12:32.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,A present.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:34.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We're at a rose garden today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:39.91,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I-I've never gotten a rose\Nfrom a man before!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:42.04,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}It's like a romance novel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:47.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.76,0:12:53.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It smells amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:55.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Like being showered in rose petals!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:55.98,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:13:00.81,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san, don't you want to \Nleave your flower in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:03.64,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I want to keep it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:07.18,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Am I coming off childish again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm glad you seem to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:14.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:18.87,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,There's a cafe in \Nthe rose garden, Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:24.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They say they use rose \Npetals in all their sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:29.33,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So many sweet smells!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:33.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,At 12 o'clock, there's a scone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:34.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,At 3, there's a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:36.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,At 6, a tart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:37.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,At 9, a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:38.64,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.53,0:13:41.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The sweets here are so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:48.10,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What does it mean \Nfor sweets to be "adorable"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:54.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They're small, topped \Nwith fruit or cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.55,0:13:56.62,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And in a variety of colors, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.71,0:14:01.81,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:04.92,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,Adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:08.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You've got cream on your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:10.34,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,O-Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:21.45,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:27.93,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I know that voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.19,0:14:30.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Karma-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:33.35,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Shizuka-chan. Excellent right hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:35.81,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:39.21,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to wait here quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:41.37,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,So, what do you want from me today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:43.22,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,What's with the cold shoulder, man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:44.47,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Where's Light-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.47,0:14:48.04,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Oh... She had other plans, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:51.64,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,She usually tells me when she's \Ngot plans, but this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:53.49,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.89,0:14:55.93,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,I'll just be gone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:02.74,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,So my day's pretty free, \Nand I came by to hang!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:04.80,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I brought you some tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:07.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Today's a work day for us, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:10.09,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hey, don't do me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:14.16,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I might look like a cool loner, \Nbut I actually need people around!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:17.39,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't see how this is my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:20.51,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Tonome-chan, are you nice \Nto everyone but me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.15,0:15:24.48,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Speak of the devil, it's my honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:29.90,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hi! It's your sweet little dark elf bae!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:32.33,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:34.70,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.89,0:15:36.12,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:39.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Karma-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.68,0:15:43.58,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Light... went back to her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:46.30,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Does this mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:48.53,Main - Top,Karma,0,0,0,,DIVORCE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.55,0:15:49.92,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Divorce is looming?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:52.37,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's not! Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:54.35,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Don't make it sound \Nlike it's on the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:57.82,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Why not go home and call her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:15:59.68,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,You're just trying to get rid of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:01.09,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Screw that! I'm staying put!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.09,0:16:01.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:05.83,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,If I have to be alone, \NI'll self-destruct from worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:07.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Aren't you a grown man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:13.54,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Can't we humor him \Nfor just a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.24,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,You mean it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:18.98,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Looks like we're roomies \Ntonight, Tonome-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:22.46,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'll help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:25.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Wait. You're staying... with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:33.88,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,ALARM - SNOOZE\NSTOP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:39.26,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,You up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:41.01,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:42.52,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Would you like a meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:44.09,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Would you like a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.09,0:16:46.78,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Or would you like...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.27,0:16:49.63,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Psych!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:50.99,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:54.28,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,There's more miso soup \Nwhere that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:58.29,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Karma-san. Have you called Light-san yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:03.29,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Nah, still too scared to ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:05.29,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'll just be staying a li'l while longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:06.92,Main - Top,SIGN,0,0,0,,WHITE MISO
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:06.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:13.95,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Mornin' all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.95,0:17:15.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.11,0:17:20.51,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Akira-san? Wh-What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You seem a bit down...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.88,0:17:24.94,Italics,Kikira,0,0,0,,{M}He looks the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:26.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:27.89,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Don't you worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.89,0:17:32.95,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I attended to every single \Nneed of my dearest Tonome-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:34.87,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,He's got energy and happiness to spare!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:36.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Please stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:38.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And stop phrasing things so suggestively.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:41.08,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Aw, Tonome-chan, you're no fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:44.45,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:49.01,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I'm feeling \Na lot better now that I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:51.70,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hey, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:54.93,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,As a thanks for letting me \Ncrash with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:58.20,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'll help you with your \Ndetective work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.77,0:18:06.31,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,So he's the target?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:07.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:11.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to follow him, \Nbut if he flies, I'll probably lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.72,0:18:13.43,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Sounds hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:13.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:16.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That makes it a rather difficult job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.18,0:18:18.75,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't need your h—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:22.32,Main - Top,Karma,0,0,0,,So you just gotta make sure \Nhe can't fly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:23.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Karma-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:39.72,Main,Bird,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:41.96,Main,Dog,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:46.01,Main,Bird,0,0,0,,My wings feel heavy. They won't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.83,0:18:49.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Karma-san. What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:52.16,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I put a curse on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.85,0:18:56.60,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Dark elves can use curses \Nto dampen the abilities of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:19:01.33,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,But I've gotta be \Nin a dark headspace for it to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This one seemed very effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:06.61,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Well... I might get divorced, so yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:09.96,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}He's more pressed than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:14.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Karma-san. You can stay \Nwith me again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:14.88,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:18.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,In exchange, please call your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:19.20,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:21.09,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.46,0:19:25.30,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Y'know, Tonome-chan, \NI can't see your face...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:27.47,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,But you're kind of intimidating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.80,0:19:30.87,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shall I dial the number for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:31.84,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,No! I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:33.10,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.12,0:19:34.60,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,Then do it yourself!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:36.80,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}They've been at this for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:36.88,Main - Top,Karma,0,0,0,,No! I need to get in the right headspace!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:38.87,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,- It's best to jump in head-first!\N- W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:38.87,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}It's like they're \Ngood friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:42.11,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,LIGHT\N LIME AUDIO
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:41.60,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:43.37,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:44.52,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:45.66,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:46.93,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:48.69,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.39,0:19:52.80,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Got it. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:55.50,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.35,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Sorry, Tonome-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:19:58.67,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I gotta go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:06.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I wonder what they talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:07.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.55,0:20:11.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I feel like a typhoon just blew through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:15.46,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Don't you like Karma-san, Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:20.06,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well... I think we're just \Nopposite personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:23.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And it's possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:28.38,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm jealous of how \Nemotionally expressive he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:33.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Would you... like to be more expressive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.91,0:20:36.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:38.07,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.31,0:20:39.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:42.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Wait, is there someone here with us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:44.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, it's just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:46.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Then get right to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:47.66,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:51.45,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Head on the shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.25,0:20:54.31,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm not too heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.73,0:20:58.11,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:01.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.56,0:21:04.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm patting your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:07.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Invisible people don't have that custom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.17,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You don't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:13.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how I feel about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:16.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Th-That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:17.79,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:21.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:26.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I thought I might touch more \Nof your face while I'm at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:28.22,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,If you like, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.74,0:21:33.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I don't get a lot of chances \Nto really feel out people's faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.27,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What about your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:38.33,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I don't even touch my family that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:40.86,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.44,0:21:46.01,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm going to touch your face, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:51.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,When I really think about it, \Nit's strange for skin to have colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:53.77,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shadows, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.05,0:21:56.95,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And it's funny how it changes color \Nwith your blood flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.91,0:21:59.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I won't be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.99,0:22:04.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Hizuha-ha. Dassh my mouf.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.91,0:22:06.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:09.93,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 5: IT WAS MY FIRST, SO...\N TO BE CONTINUED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:08.09,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,'Sokah.
